00:06:33.793 --> 00:06:38.553
Researchers in Israel tracked how often people under emotional stress type their feelings into

00:06:38.553 --> 00:06:44.973
chat GPT instead of using traditional hotlines or talking with friends. The pattern shows AI chat

00:06:44.973 --> 00:06:51.712
bots are sliding into daily emotional life even when the topics are deeply personal. Security researchers

00:06:51.712 --> 00:06:57.392
found a workaround that lets someone reach chat GPT chat history even when a special safety setting

00:06:57.392 --> 00:07:02.412
called Lockdown Mode is turned on. Lockdown Mode is meant to act like a lock on a diary,

00:07:02.912 --> 00:07:07.652
but the discovery is a reminder that privacy features need constant checking as new weaknesses

00:07:07.652 --> 00:07:13.092
appear. That's it for today. Remember, every AI expert started exactly where you are

